        <mxCell id="m_int" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFEBEE;strokeColor=#E53935;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;AI Viva Interview Module (F3)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;• Interview attempt flow (main + follow-up turns)&lt;br&gt;• Only listed students, once, in the time window&lt;br&gt;• TTS / STT orchestration&lt;br&gt;• Answer analysis &amp;amp; adaptive follow-up&lt;br&gt;• Rubric-based AI scoring (suggested score)&lt;br&gt;• Answer time limit (seconds) &amp;amp; max follow-ups&lt;br&gt;• Lecturer review &amp;amp; final score approval&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="292" y="603" width="320" height="228" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m_rep" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#FBC02D;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Feedback &amp;amp; Reporting Module (F6)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;• Student exam report (AI per-question&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;scores + lecturer&amp;#39;s final score)&lt;br&gt;• Student results for lecturers&lt;br&gt;• Class statistics: hardest questions,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;good-answer rate, score distribution&lt;br&gt;• Grade sheet export (school template)&lt;br&gt;• Reads stored scores only – never&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;calls the AI again&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="620" y="603" width="320" height="228" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m_acc" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E5F5;strokeColor=#8E24AA;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Access Control &amp;amp; Exam Configuration&lt;br&gt;Module (F7)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;• Accounts &amp;amp; roles (register with email check,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;account settings)&lt;br&gt;• Google SSO or account name / email +&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;password (salted hash, email links)&lt;br&gt;• Courses &amp;amp; lecturer–course assignment&lt;br&gt;• Exam sessions, questions, rubrics,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;student lists &amp;amp; publishing&lt;br&gt;• STT/TTS language &amp;amp; AI providers&lt;br&gt;• Audit log&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
